 "texts": [
  {
   "str": "Before electricity,",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 0.9,
   "until": 2.57027027027027,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "when the sun went down,",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 2.62027027027027,
   "until": 4.652702702702702,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "the world went dark.",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 4.702702702702702,
   "until": 6.463513513513512,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "Really dark.",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 6.513513513513512,
   "until": 7.549999999999999,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "So what did people actually do",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 8,
   "until": 10.411538461538461,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "all night? The answer is",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 10.461538461538462,
   "until": 12.38076923076923,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "stranger than you think.",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 12.430769230769231,
   "until": 14.35,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "First, light cost money.",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 15,
   "until": 16.610377358490567,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "Beeswax candles were for the",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 16.660377358490567,
   "until": 18.54748427672956,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "rich. Most families burned smoky",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 18.59748427672956,
   "until": 20.76132075471698,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "tallow, made from animal fat.",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 20.81132075471698,
   "until": 22.76761006289308,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "The poorest just dipped dried",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 22.81761006289308,
   "until": 24.77389937106918,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "rushes in grease.",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 24.82389937106918,
   "until": 25.95,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "In medieval towns, an evening",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 26.5,
   "until": 28.50965909090909,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "bell told everyone to cover",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 28.55965909090909,
   "until": 30.427272727272726,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "their fires, so wooden houses",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 30.477272727272727,
   "until": 32.48693181818182,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "wouldn't burn down.",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 32.53693181818182,
   "until": 33.83636363636364,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "Cover fire, in French,",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 33.88636363636364,
   "until": 35.39886363636364,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "is couvre-feu. That's where we",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 35.44886363636364,
   "until": 37.52954545454546,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "get the word curfew.",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 37.57954545454546,
   "until": 38.95000000000001,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "With no light and little to do,",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 39.5,
   "until": 42.12241379310345,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "most people were in bed within",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 42.172413793103445,
   "until": 44.70862068965517,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "an hour or two after dark.",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 44.75862068965517,
   "until": 46.949999999999996,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "But here's the twist.",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 47.5,
   "until": 49.09825581395349,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "Historian Roger Ekirch found",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 49.14825581395349,
   "until": 51.29593023255814,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "thousands of old records",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 51.34593023255814,
   "until": 53.1796511627907,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "describing two sleeps.",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 53.229651162790695,
   "until": 54.90639534883721,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "A first sleep, then waking up",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 54.956395348837205,
   "until": 57.18255813953488,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "after midnight, and a second",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 57.23255813953488,
   "until": 59.38023255813953,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "sleep until morning.",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 59.43023255813953,
   "until": 60.949999999999996,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "That break could last an hour or",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 61.5,
   "until": 64.49294478527608,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "more, and people used it.",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 64.54294478527608,
   "until": 66.87024539877301,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "They prayed, thought about their",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 66.920245398773,
   "until": 69.91319018404909,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "dreams, talked with family,",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 69.96319018404908,
   "until": 72.48067484662577,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "tended the fire, and even",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 72.53067484662577,
   "until": 74.8579754601227,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "visited the neighbors.",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 74.9079754601227,
   "until": 76.95,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "And yes, a few used the darkness",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 77.5,
   "until": 81.08636363636364,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "to steal their neighbor's",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 81.13636363636364,
   "until": 83.92727272727274,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "firewood.",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 83.97727272727273,
   "until": 84.95,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "Then came artificial light.",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 85.5,
   "until": 87.51052631578948,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "Gas lamps, and later electric",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 87.56052631578947,
   "until": 89.72368421052632,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "bulbs, kept the night bright.",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 89.77368421052631,
   "until": 91.93684210526315,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "People stayed up later,",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 91.98684210526315,
   "until": 93.69210526315788,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "and by the eighteen hundreds,",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 93.74210526315788,
   "until": 95.90526315789472,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "that first sleep slowly",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 95.95526315789472,
   "until": 97.66052631578945,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "stretched into one long night.",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 97.71052631578945,
   "until": 99.94999999999997,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "So if you ever wake up in the",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 100.5,
   "until": 103.46298701298701,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "middle of the night,",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 103.51298701298701,
   "until": 105.5409090909091,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "don't panic. For centuries,",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 105.5909090909091,
   "until": 108.3461038961039,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "a break in the night was",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 108.3961038961039,
   "until": 110.83961038961039,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "perfectly normal. Subscribe for",
   "y": 446,
   "at": 110.88961038961038,
   "until": 114.0603896103896,
   "write": 0
  },
  {
   "str": "more forgotten history.",
   "y": 446,
